  "body": "bluetuith v0.2.7\r\n\r\nThis release contains the following changes:\r\n- Adapted to new tview changes\r\n- Backend fixes\r\n- Fixed OBEX and Media Player events and progress rendering\r\n- Minor bugfixes\r\n\r\nFor Windows/MacOS:\r\n- libhbluetooth needs to be installed. Follow the [download instructions](https://github.com/bluetuith-org/libhbluetooth) and place the libhbluetooth dynamic library file next to the bluetuith binary."
